[gd_resource type="Resource" load_steps=2 format=2]

[ext_resource path="res://addons/dialogue_manager/dialogue_resource.gd" type="Script" id=1]

[resource]
script = ExtResource( 1 )
resource_version = 51
syntax_version = 2
raw_text = "~ level1_intro
Angel: Welcome, brave Magical Girl!
Angel: There is a lot of [shake rate=7 level=15]EVIL[/shake] things going on in this forest... so thank goodness you're here!
Angel: Make sure to take a good look at the controls before you start. [wait=1.5]
Angel: You ready? Let's go [wave]save the day![/wave]


~ level1_event1

Angel: Bees? Un-BEE-leivable [wait=1.5]
% Angel: You're doing great, by the way!
% Angel: I wonder what happened to the creatures here...
% Angel: It's a great day for defeating enemies!
% Angel: By the way, have you ever been to IKEA?
% Angel: Here they come!
% Angel: Such splendid gold ores!
% Angel: ...Do you watch anime?
% Angel: Wow, nicely done!
% Angel: At least it's not raining... Can you imagine fighting in the rain?
% Angel: And [shake]SNAKES[/shake] too!?
% Angel: So... how's the weather in 'your world'?
% Angel: You like jazz, right?
% Angel: You should watch Eva! It's about angels, you know.
% Angel: ...I like your dress, by the way!
% Angel: Just being real with you, that dress is kinda not your style... Just kidding! [wait=1] ..Or am I?
% Angel: [speed=0.5]... \\nlmao


~ level1_event2

~ level1_event_boss
Big Bird of Darkness: [speed=0.2] I AM THE [shake rate=7 level=15]DARKNESS[/shake]. 
Big Bird of Darkness: [speed=0.2] I AM THE [shake rate=7 level=15]NIGHT[/shake].

~ level1_event_end
Angel: You did it! You defeated the Bird of Darkness and saved the forest!
Angel: ...But what was that weird thing on top of that bird?"
